WEBVTT

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:01.717
Calling Cormorant!

00:00:01.757 --> 00:00:03.054
Are you in one piece?

00:00:03.095 --> 00:00:06.139
Good. Looks like the tank
turned into a shower.

00:00:08.082 --> 00:00:09.630
That's all you brought back.

00:00:09.669 --> 00:00:11.907
Less than three quarters of a tank.

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:16.292
Cap, this is far too little.

00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:19.196
The water won't even last
to the end of the week.

00:00:20.082 --> 00:00:22.604
Here, every liter is someone's day.

00:00:22.644 --> 00:00:26.436
Remember: dive more often
and don't touch the force field.

00:00:27.082 --> 00:00:30.392
We'll patch up the tank,
and you can fly for water again.

00:00:30.432 --> 00:00:32.544
The canyon guards are on alert now!

00:00:34.082 --> 00:00:36.830
Get ready,
you'll have to fly once more, pilot.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.149
We're waiting for you.
